        {
          "kind": "because",
          "text": "由基本不等式，\\(\\frac{\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{1}{y}}{2}\\ge\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{xy}}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{xy}}\\)"
